Class CatalogEntityType:
- enumerate champion/item/rune lookup scopes

Class CatalogEntitySummary:
- minimal display payload for catalog lists

Class CatalogLookupResult:
- extend summary with entity_type and game for mixed lookup results

Class CatalogVersionPayload:
- expose current/available data version metadata

Class CatalogVersionListPayload:
- wrap multiple CatalogVersionPayload records

Class CatalogCollectionPayload:
- wrap champions/items/runes list responses

Class CatalogLookupPayload:
- wrap search query plus result rows

Class CatalogQueryOptions:
- centralize shared optional catalog query fields
